== Research and teaching assistance

- College Advisor and Research Member of Common Room in Kellogg College, University of Oxford, 2026 --
- Teaching Assistant for the course Modeling of Dynamical Systems at Tu/Delft in 2022 and 2023.
- Teaching Assistant for the course The Principle of Automatic Control at Beihang University in 2019 and 2020.
- Research Assistant in the [https://www.au.tsinghua.edu.cn/ Department of Automation], Tsinghua University, China, in 2021. I worked on designing learning-based controllers for autonomous bicycles to achieve balancing and tracking tasks.
- Supervised a master's project on using max-min-plus-scaling neural networks to approximate piecewise affine model predictive control laws.

